/P 673 0 R
/T (A player who is suspected to have suffered a head injury may be substituted while being evaluated by a Qualified Medical Professional \(QMP\). The substitution for the evaluation of the concussion/head injury will not count against the team's total number of substitution moments in the match \(temporary substitution\).)
/E (A player who is suspected to have suffered a head injury may be substituted while being evaluated by a Qualified Medical Professional \(QMP\). The substitution for the evaluation of the concussion/head injury will not count against the team's total number of substitution moments in the match \(temporary substitution\).)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 674 0 R
/T (If the player is deemed by a QMP to not have suffered a concussion, the player may re-enter the match at any stoppage of play and must replace the temporary substitute; this head injury evaluation substitution will not count as a substitution moment. Furthermore, the temporary substitute will be able to re-enter the match at a later time if not previously substituted out earlier in the match for a non-head related substitution.)
/E (If the player is deemed by a QMP to not have suffered a concussion, the player may re-enter the match at any stoppage of play and must replace the temporary substitute; this head injury evaluation substitution will not count as a substitution moment. Furthermore, the temporary substitute will be able to re-enter the match at a later time if not previously substituted out earlier in the match for a non-head related substitution.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
